### ================================================================
### TAKEAWAY WORKFLOW — BUKTI E2E: PEMBELI TRACK ORDER TANPA LOGIN
### ================================================================
### Tujuan  : membuktikan order standalone (TAKEAWAY, dibuat staf)
###           bisa dilacak pembeli via trackToken — tanpa akun,
###           tanpa QR meja, read-only.
### Kontrak : API_CONTRACT.md §L4 (Guest Order Tracking), §J (orders)
###
### Prasyarat:
###   1. App jalan di {{baseUrl}} (localhost:8081), DB fresh (drop-create).
###   2. Data menu dev tersedia (menuId 1/2, modifierOptionId 13).
###      CATATAN SEED: menuId 1 & 2 punya modifierType "Size" (minSelection 1)
###      → order item-nya WAJIB membawa option Size (mis. 13=Regular).
###      Tanpa itu: 400 "Modifier type 4 requires at least 1 selection(s)".
###   3. Jalankan step BERURUTAN. Sesuaikan ID/orderId dengan hasil run lo.
###   4. Copy trackToken dari response STEP 1 ke {{trackToken}}
###      (tambahkan variabel di http-client.env.json lokal).
###
### Yang DIBUKTIKAN (checklist §CHECKLIST):
###   [T1] Setiap order bawa trackToken di OrderResponse
###   [T2] Pembeli tanpa login bisa melihat status + isi order
###   [T3] Status berubah terlihat lewat polling (CONFIRMED→PREPARING→READY)
###   [T4] invoiceStatus terlihat tamu (OPEN → PAID setelah kasir bayar)
###   [T5] Status terminal tetap terbaca (riwayat, bukan hilang)
###   [T6] Token salah → 404 generik, tanpa bocor info


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 1 — STAF MEMBUAT ORDER TAKEAWAY
### ================================================================

### STEP 1: Kasir catat order takeaway (staf, order.create)
### Ekspektasi: 201; response OrderResponse berisi trackToken
### → copy trackToken ke {{trackToken}}, catat orderId-nya
### [T1]
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "TAKEAWAY",
    "customerName": "Bu Tejo",
    "notes": "Dibungkus kardus",
    "items": [
        {
            "menuId": 1,
            "quantity": 2,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 13 }
            ]
        },
        {
            "menuId": 2,
            "quantity": 1,
            "modifiers": [
                { "modifierOptionId": 13 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### STEP 1b: Kasir confirm → antrean dapur
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (Invoice standalone sudah terbit otomatis saat create — event AFTER_COMMIT.
###  Cek via endpoint staf bila mau: GET /invoices?orderId={{orderId}})


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 2 — PEMBELI TRACK (PUBLIK, TANPA LOGIN SAMA SEKALI)
### ================================================================

### STEP 2: Pembeli buka link tracking (mis. dari WA/struk — FE: /guest/track/{trackToken})
### Ekspektasi: 200 — orderNumber, type=TAKEAWAY, status=CONFIRMED,
###             totalPrice, items[] (+ modifiers), invoiceStatus=OPEN
### [T2]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/{{trackToken}}

### STEP 2b: Polling — dapur mulai masak
### (jalankan STEP 4 dulu, lalu GET ini lagi → status PREPARING)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/{{trackToken}}

### STEP 2c: Polling — makanan siap diambil
### (jalankan STEP 5 dulu, lalu GET ini lagi → status READY)
### [T3]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/{{trackToken}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 3 — DAPUR MEMPROSES (identitas staf/kitchen)
### ================================================================

### STEP 4: Prepare (kitchen — order.mark.preparing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/prepare
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 5: Ready (kitchen — order.mark.ready)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/ready
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 4 — KASIR MENAGIH & MENERIMA PEMBAYARAN
### ================================================================

### STEP 6: Kasir cari invoice order ini (query orderId — lihat §P)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices?orderId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 7: Bayar (kasir — payment.create). amount kosong = lunas penuh
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "invoiceId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "CASH-TAKEAWAY-001"
}

### STEP 7b: Pembeli track lagi → invoiceStatus kini PAID
### [T4]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/{{trackToken}}


### ================================================================
### TAHAP 5 — SELESAI & RIWAYAT
### ================================================================

### STEP 8: Kasir complete (pesanan sudah diambil)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### STEP 8b: Track setelah terminal — tetap 200, status COMPLETED (riwayat)
### [T5]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/{{trackToken}}


### ================================================================
### NEGATIVE SUITE
### ================================================================

### Token salah (404 generik "Order not found" — tidak membocorkan apa pun)
### [T6]
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/wrongtoken123

### Tanpa token (404 — path tidak match, bukan 401/403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/guest/orders/

### POST tidak ada di jalur ini — tracking read-only.
### Bila POST dicoba, hasilnya 401/403/405 (bukan akses yang sah).


### ================================================================
### CHECKLIST — centang setelah run
### ================================================================
### [T1] STEP 1  : OrderResponse.trackToken terisi (32 byte, Base64URL)
### [T2] STEP 2  : 200 tanpa Authorization; payload lengkap + items[]
### [T3] STEP 2c : status berubah CONFIRMED → PREPARING → READY via polling
### [T4] STEP 7b : invoiceStatus OPEN → PAID setelah pembayaran kasir
### [T5] STEP 8b : status COMPLETED masih terbaca (200)
### [T6] NEGATIVE: token salah → 404 "Order not found"
###
### Kalau 6/6 tercentang → workflow "takeaway order & track" TERBUKTI
### end-to-end dengan kode saat ini.
###
### Catatan tambahan:
### - Order DINE_IN juga bawa trackToken (di-generate di semua jalur create),
###   tapi tracking dine-in tetap disarankan via guestToken sesi (§L2) karena
###   satu sesi bisa berisi banyak order.
### - FE merender QR/link dari trackToken sama seperti guestToken —
###   lihat FE-ROLE-INTEGRATION.md §3.6.
